# Trivy ignore list — accepted vulnerabilities, with justification.
#
# Image scans run with `--ignore-unfixed`, so only vulnerabilities that have a
# published fix are reported. Remaining findings are base-image (Node runtime /
# Alpine OS) issues that are resolved by rebuilding on refreshed base images;
# the image-scan job is reporting-only and does not gate on them.
#
# Add specific CVE IDs below (one per line) only after reviewing and accepting
# them, e.g.:
# CVE-2025-XXXXX  # accepted: base-image OS package, not reachable from the app
